  "steps": [
    "Soak the chana dal for 30 minutes, then pressure-cook with turmeric, salt and 3 cups of water for 4 whistles until tender but whole.",
    "Heat 1 tbsp ghee in a pan, add the coconut slivers and fry until lightly golden; remove and set aside.",
    "In the same pan add the remaining ghee, cumin seeds, dried red chilli, bay leaf, cinnamon, cardamom and cloves.",
    "Add the ginger paste and cumin powder, stir for 30 seconds, then add the cooked dal with its liquid.",
    "Add the sugar and half of the fried coconut, and simmer for 10 minutes until slightly thick.",
    "Finish with garam masala and the remaining coconut on top."
  ]
